{"sections":{"image_banner":{"type":"image-banner","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Inspired_by_Cinderella_1200_x_400_px_15.svg","image_overlay_opacity":0,"image_height":"adapt","image_behavior":"none","desktop_content_position":"middle-center","desktop_content_alignment":"center","show_text_box":false,"color_scheme":"scheme-1","stack_images_on_mobile":true,"mobile_content_alignment":"center","show_text_below":false}},"rich_text_HFrLXp":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"text_DexnWi":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Step into the circle of life and explore destinations inspired by the landscapes, wildlife, and spirit of <em>The Lion King<\/em>. From the lemur-filled forests and baobab landscapes of Madagascar, to the sweeping savannahs of Tanzania and Kenya, each destination offers its own chapter of adventure and discovery. Disney Parks bring the story to life with immersive experiences, themed hotels, and unforgettable shows that let you feel part of Simba’s world.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["text_DexnWi"],"name":"t:sections.rich-text.presets.name","settings":{"desktop_content_position":"center","content_alignment":"center","color_scheme":"","full_width":true,"padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":40}},"image_with_text_4rrWpk":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_JfPGDy":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"<strong>Madagascar<\/strong>","heading_size":"h2"}},"text_ggcHNL":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>A standout destination for wildlife lovers, Madagascar feels like a living storybook. Wander through ancient baobab avenues, explore lush rainforests alive with playful lemurs, and discover colourful creatures found nowhere else on Earth. With its wild landscapes, vibrant culture, and otherworldly scenery, Madagascar brings the spirit of <em>The Lion King<\/em> to life in a uniquely unforgettable way.<\/p><p><em><strong>Click <\/strong><\/em><a href=\"https:\/\/travefy.com\/f\/6ws9rqkqdm6qra2uwxzbsp2cw3vtttj3ha\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/travefy.com\/f\/6ws9rqkqdm6qra2uwxzbsp2cw3vtttj3ha\"><em><strong>HERE<\/strong><\/em><\/a><em><strong> to bring your Madagascar story to life. <\/strong><\/em><\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["heading_JfPGDy","text_ggcHNL"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.presets.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/1300x820.webp","height":"medium","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","image_behavior":"none","content_layout":"overlap","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","mobile_content_alignment":"left","section_color_scheme":"","color_scheme":"","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"image_with_text_wHPt4n":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_kxNwiW":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"<strong>Serengeti National Park, Tanzania<\/strong>","heading_size":"h2"}},"text_4PUjgq":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Experience the sweeping savannahs and iconic wildlife of the Serengeti. Witness roaming herds, lions, elephants, giraffes, and zebras in their natural habitats, and feel the epic scale of Africa’s most legendary landscapes.<\/p><p><em><strong>Click <\/strong><\/em><a href=\"https:\/\/travefy.com\/f\/6ws9rqkqdm6qra2uwxzbsp2cw3vtttj3ha\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/travefy.com\/f\/6ws9rqkqdm6qra2uwxzbsp2cw3vtttj3ha\"><em><strong>HERE<\/strong><\/em><\/a><em><strong> to step into your Serengeti chapter and live your own wild adventure.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["heading_kxNwiW","text_4PUjgq"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.presets.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/great-wildebeest-migration.-1030x542.jpg","height":"medium","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","image_behavior":"none","content_layout":"overlap","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","mobile_content_alignment":"left","section_color_scheme":"","color_scheme":"","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"image_with_text_EBCCWn":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_KxPYmx":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"<strong>Maasai Mara & Giraffe Manor, Kenya<\/strong>","heading_size":"h2"}},"text_Vrhadp":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>The Maasai Mara offers stunning savannahs, abundant wildlife, and a chance to see the Big Five. For a truly storybook experience, stay at<strong>Giraffe Manor<\/strong>, where curious giraffes visit your breakfast window, making every moment feel like part of your own African adventure.<\/p><p><em><strong>Click <\/strong><\/em><a href=\"https:\/\/travefy.com\/f\/6ws9rqkqdm6qra2uwxzbsp2cw3vtttj3ha\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/travefy.com\/f\/6ws9rqkqdm6qra2uwxzbsp2cw3vtttj3ha\"><em><strong>HERE<\/strong><\/em><\/a><em><strong> to explore Kenya and experience a giraffe-filled chapter of your story.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["heading_KxPYmx","text_Vrhadp"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.presets.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/613a6b1587847c4c5889db0b_Nelson-Travel-Giraffe-Manor.jpg","height":"medium","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","image_behavior":"none","content_layout":"overlap","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","mobile_content_alignment":"left","section_color_scheme":"","color_scheme":"","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"image_with_text_dYxihL":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_i46LR4":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"<strong>Okavango Delta, Botswana<\/strong>","heading_size":"h2"}},"text_QiUHhp":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>A lush oasis in the heart of the desert, the Okavango Delta is a maze of lagoons and waterways teeming with hippos, crocodiles, birds, and other incredible wildlife. Glide through the delta by mokoro canoe and explore landscapes that feel straight out of a storybook.<\/p><p><em><strong>Click <\/strong><\/em><a href=\"https:\/\/travefy.com\/f\/6ws9rqkqdm6qra2uwxzbsp2cw3vtttj3ha\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/travefy.com\/f\/6ws9rqkqdm6qra2uwxzbsp2cw3vtttj3ha\"><em><strong>HERE<\/strong><\/em><\/a><em><strong> to glide through the Okavango Delta and write your own chapter of wonder.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["heading_i46LR4","text_QiUHhp"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.presets.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Ariel-Shot-of-Okavango-Delta-_-Wynand-Uys-1024x637-1.webp","height":"medium","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","image_behavior":"none","content_layout":"overlap","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","mobile_content_alignment":"left","section_color_scheme":"","color_scheme":"","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"image_with_text_3raWYT":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_cegXGQ":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"<strong>Disney Parks Around the World<\/strong>","heading_size":"h2"}},"text_RgejBC":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p> Bring the majesty of<em>The Lion King<\/em>to life at Disney Parks. Visit<strong>Animal Kingdom at Walt Disney World<\/strong>and stay at the<strong>Animal Kingdom Lodge<\/strong>, where wildlife roams just outside your window. Enjoy the<strong>Festival of the Lion King<\/strong>live show at Walt Disney World or Hong Kong Disneyland, and experience Simba’s story through interactive encounters, and immersive adventures that transport you straight into the heart of the tale.<\/p><p><em><strong>Click <\/strong><\/em><a href=\"https:\/\/travefy.com\/f\/6ws9rqkqdm6qra2uwxzbsp2cw3vtttj3ha\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/travefy.com\/f\/6ws9rqkqdm6qra2uwxzbsp2cw3vtttj3ha\"><em><strong>HERE<\/strong><\/em><\/a><em><strong> to begin your Disney Parks chapter and experience the magic of The Lion King.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["heading_cegXGQ","text_RgejBC"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.presets.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/7753344710_43d960f4f4.jpg","height":"medium","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","image_behavior":"none","content_layout":"overlap","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","mobile_content_alignment":"left","section_color_scheme":"","color_scheme":"","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}}},"order":["image_banner","rich_text_HFrLXp","image_with_text_4rrWpk","image_with_text_wHPt4n","image_with_text_EBCCWn","image_with_text_dYxihL","image_with_text_3raWYT"]}